# Third-party code and documents vendored into this skill

This skill is self-contained. It has no runtime dependency on any folder outside it.

The files below originate in Ivan Falco's `curated-abm-skills` kit
(https://github.com/ivangfalco/curated-abm-skills), MIT licensed, and were copied in on
2026-09-24 so that a published copy of this skill runs for anyone who clones it.

    scripts/build_campaign.py        modified, see below
    scripts/narrow_audience.py       modified, env path only
    scripts/resolve_and_size.py      modified, env path only
    knowledge-base/ad-copywriting.md          verbatim
    knowledge-base/linkedin-ads-abm-guide.md  verbatim

Local modifications, all in this skill, none upstream:

  - All four scripts read `~/.config/abm-1to1/secrets.env` when no `.env` sits beside them.
  - `build_campaign.py` treats a required config key that is present but null as missing,
    and exits before Phase 1 instead of failing once per company at Phase 6.
  - `build_campaign.py` calls `ad_account_guard.assert_writable()` before any write.
  - `build_campaign.py` `upload_image()` sends no Authorization header on the pre-signed
    PUT, and sets `Content-Type: image/png` (patched 2026-09-02).

`scripts/ad_account_guard.py` is not part of the upstream kit.

